<title>INDIA: India repos auction cut-off rate steady at 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>India repos auction cut-off rate steady at 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Saturday it maintained the cut-off rate at 5.0 percent at its four-day auction of government of India securities.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received nine bids for 18.3 billion rupees of which it accepted six for 16.05 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off rate was 5.0 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
